   Spearman( median |r| in ticks , mean z ) = +0.5886   on 35 roots
   A POSITIVE rank correlation is the bounce signature: the coarser a root's tick relative
   to its 5-minute move, the further its efficiency falls below the exchangeable value.

   And the roots whose moves are LARGEST in ticks -- where bounce matters least:
